echo "==> The compliance-ladder leg: silence escalates, a plain pull resets" >&2
# PRJ-179's verified-by. Two receipts: the four real opencode sessions above
# are the client-wiring half — each of their prompts reported a content-free
# turn (the pull leg rides tool execution, which the stub model never does).
# The mechanics run through the same /compliance route the clients post to:
# a no-pull conversation escalates tier by tier, past the cap it goes quiet,
# a plain pull resets the ladder onto a fresh tier one, and the report
